 writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/focusedSceneValue(_:_:)-831pq":{"title":"focusedSceneValue(_:_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/focusedscenevalue(_:_:)-831pq","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/focusedSceneValue(_:_:)-831pq","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"focusedSceneValue","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s15WritableKeyPathC","text":"WritableKeyPath","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI13FocusedValuesV","text":"FocusedValues","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?>, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","type":"topic","title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}]}}}